       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI55502.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI55502.
      *
      *     Detalhe da Linha do Extracto
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI55502         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5806 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5550.
       COPY SWCV5551.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT5806 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5806'.
           05 CON-CCODEST-HIST-PENDENTE     PIC  X(02) VALUE 'HP'.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME            PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI55502'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI55502         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5550-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5550-ASE       TO SWCV5551-ASE.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5550-ADE       TO SWCV5551-ADE.



           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2100-OBTEM-DADOS
                 THRU 2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF

           .
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-OBTEM-DADOS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-OBTEM-DADOS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-OBTEM-DADOS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              MOVE 'SWCV5550-COSN   ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(1)
              MOVE  SWCV5550-COSN     TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(1)
              MOVE 'SWCV5550-COSNC  ' TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-NM(2)
              MOVE  SWCV5550-COSNC    TO VIAL0015-CAMPO-VLR(2)
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
AG    *    MOVE SWCV5550-CCODMSG           TO SWCD5806-CCODMSG.
|     *    MOVE SWCV5550-DATVAL            TO AQCW0005-DTX10.
|     *    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8
|     *       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT10INDT8-EXIT.
AG    *    MOVE AQCW0005-DT98              TO SWCD5806-DATVAL.
           MOVE SWCV5550-COSN              TO SWCD5806-COSN.
           MOVE SWCV5550-COSNC             TO SWCD5806-COSNC.
AG    *    MOVE SWCV5550-CREF              TO SWCD5806-CREF.
      *
           EXEC SQL
              SELECT CCODMSG
                   , DATVAL
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , CREF
                   , CREFOPR
                   , CREFEXT
                   , CSEND
                   , CBAN
                   , CSPAI
                   , CCODEST
                   , CTIPOP
                   , MVALOR
                   , CMOED
                   , DATREC
                   , CTIPREC
                   , CTRATRYP
                   , CCODOPE
                   , CDBCR
                   , DREG
                   , NOPRREC
                   , MOTIVO
                   , OBSER
                   , GDESC
                   , CBYPASS
                   , CSENDREC
                   , MVLRREC
                   , CMOEDREC
                   , CROPRREC
                   , CORIGEMREC
                   , CNIVREC
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   , CEXT
                   , CPAG
                   , NORDREC
                INTO :SWCD5806-CCODMSG
                   , :SWCD5806-DATVAL
                   , :SWCD5806-COSN
                   , :SWCD5806-COSNC
                   , :SWCD5806-CREF
                   , :SWCD5806-CREFOPR
                   , :SWCD5806-CREFEXT
                   , :SWCD5806-CSEND
                   , :SWCD5806-CBAN
                   , :SWCD5806-CSPAI
                   , :SWCD5806-CCODEST
                   , :SWCD5806-CTIPOP
                   , :SWCD5806-MVALOR
                   , :SWCD5806-CMOED
                   , :SWCD5806-DATREC
                   , :SWCD5806-CTIPREC
                   , :SWCD5806-CTRATRYP
                   , :SWCD5806-CCODOPE
                   , :SWCD5806-CDBCR
                   , :SWCD5806-DREG
                   , :SWCD5806-NOPRREC
                   , :SWCD5806-MOTIVO
                   , :SWCD5806-OBSER
                   , :SWCD5806-GDESC
                   , :SWCD5806-CBYPASS
                   , :SWCD5806-CSENDREC
                   , :SWCD5806-MVLRREC
                   , :SWCD5806-CMOEDREC
                   , :SWCD5806-CROPRREC
                   , :SWCD5806-CORIGEMREC
                   , :SWCD5806-CNIVREC
                   , :SWCD5806-CUSERID
                   , :SWCD5806-HTIMEST
                   , :SWCD5806-CEXT
                   , :SWCD5806-CPAG
                   , :SWCD5806-NORDREC
                FROM SWVT5806
AG    *        WHERE CCODMSG   =  :SWCD5806-CCODMSG
AG    *          AND DATVAL    =  :SWCD5806-DATVAL
               WHERE COSN      =  :SWCD5806-COSN
                 AND COSNC     =  :SWCD5806-COSNC
AG    *          AND CREF      =  :SWCD5806-CREF
           END-EXEC.
      *
           MOVE CON-SWVT5806               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.
      *
           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.
      *
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-OK
                 IF VIAL0001-CRIACAO
AG    *             MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
|     *               TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *               TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-S
|     *             MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-EXISTS
|     *               TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-MSG
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *               TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *               TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-S
|     *             MOVE SWCK0001-DATVAL-EXISTS
|     *               TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-MSG
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *               TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-CAPLIC
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *               TO SWCV5551-COSN-S
|     *             MOVE SWCK0001-COSN-EXISTS
|     *               TO SWCV5551-COSN-MSG
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *               TO SWCV5551-COSN-CAPLIC
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *               TO SWCV5551-COSNC-S
|     *             MOVE SWCK0001-COSNC-EXISTS
|     *               TO SWCV5551-COSNC-MSG
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *               TO SWCV5551-COSNC-CAPLIC
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *               TO SWCV5551-CREF-S
|     *             MOVE SWCK0001-CREF-EXISTS
|     *               TO SWCV5551-CREF-MSG
|     *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *               TO SWCV5551-CREF-CAPLIC
AG                  CONTINUE
                 ELSE
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CCODMSG  TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG
                    MOVE SWCD5806-DATVAL   TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5551-DATVAL
                    MOVE SWCD5806-COSN     TO SWCV5551-COSN
                    MOVE SWCD5806-COSNC    TO SWCV5551-COSNC
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CREF     TO SWCV5551-CREF
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CREFOPR  TO SWCV5551-CREFOPR
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CREFEXT  TO SWCV5551-CREFEXT
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CSEND    TO SWCV5551-CSEND
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CCODEST  TO SWCV5551-CCODEST
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CTIPOP   TO SWCV5551-CTIPOP
                    MOVE SWCD5806-MVALOR   TO SWCV5551-MVALOR
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CMOED    TO SWCV5551-CMOED
                    MOVE SWCD5806-DATREC   TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5551-DATREC
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CTIPREC  TO SWCV5551-CTIPREC
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CTRATRYP TO SWCV5551-CTRATRYP
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CCODOPE  TO SWCV5551-CCODOPE
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CDBCR    TO SWCV5551-CDBCR
                    MOVE SWCD5806-DREG     TO AQCW0005-DT98
                    PERFORM AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10
                       THRU AQCP0005-CONV-DT8INDT10-EXIT
                    MOVE AQCW0005-DTX10    TO SWCV5551-DREG
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CEXT     TO SWCV5551-CEXT
                    MOVE SWCD5806-CPAG     TO SWCV5551-CPAG
                    IF VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                       MOVE SWCD5806-NOPRREC
                                           TO SWCV5551-MRNOPRX
AG                                            SWCV5551-MRNOPR
                       MOVE SWCD5806-NORDREC
                                           TO SWCV5551-MRNORDX
AG                                            SWCV5551-MRNORD
                    ELSE
                       MOVE SWCV5550-MRNOPR
                                           TO SWCV5551-MRNOPRX
                       MOVE SWCV5550-MRNORD
                                           TO SWCV5551-MRNORDX
AG    *                IF SWCD5806-CCODEST NOT EQUAL
|     *                                        CON-CCODEST-HIST-PENDENTE
|     *                                    AND SWCK0002-CODEST-PEND
|     *                   MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
|     *                     TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
|     *                   MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
|     *                     TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-S
|     *                   MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-A-EXISTS
|     *                     TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-MSG
|     *                   MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
|     *                     TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
AG    *                END-IF
                    END-IF
                    MOVE SWCD5806-OBSER    TO SWCV5551-OBSER
                    IF NOT VIAL0001-VISUALIZACAO
                        CONTINUE
                    END-IF
                 END-IF
              ELSE
                 IF NOT VIAL0001-CRIACAO
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CCODMSG-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-CCODMSG-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-DATVAL-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-DATVAL-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSN-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-COSN-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-COSNC-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-COSNC-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5551-CREF-CAPLIC
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           END-IF.


       2199-OBTEM-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.



      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5551-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5551-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5551-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY AQCP0005.
